<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Reset Password · Project Review Portal</title>
    <style>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        font-family: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #eef2f6;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: #1e2b3c;
      }
      .email-card {
        max-width: 580px;
        width: 100%;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 15px 35px -8px rgba(0, 20, 30, 0.15), 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .accent-bar {
        height: 8px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4a0b0b 0%, #9c1e1e 45%, #e03030 100%);
        width: 100%;
      }
      .content { padding: 40px 40px 32px; }
      @media (max-width: 480px) { .content { padding: 28px 22px 24px; } }
      h1 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0b2b4a; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.2; }
      .greeting { font-size: 16px; color: #2d4d6e; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 500; }
      .message { font-size: 15px; color: #406078; margin-bottom: 28px; line-height: 1.6; }
      .message strong { color: #0b2b4a; font-weight: 600; }
      .otp-block { margin: 28px 0 24px; text-align: center; }
      .otp-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5e7a94; margin-bottom: 10px; }
      .otp-code {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #fff0f0;
        padding: 16px 28px;
        border-radius: 60px;
        font-size: 40px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 10px;
        color: #7a0000;
        font-family: "Inter", "Courier New", monospace;
        border: 1px solid #f5c2c2;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(150, 0, 0, 0.06);
        word-break: break-word;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }
      @media (max-width: 480px) { .otp-code { font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: 6px; padding: 14px 20px; } }
      .expiry-note {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 8px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #7a2f2f;
        background: #fff5f5;
        padding: 12px 18px;
        border-radius: 40px;
        margin: 24px auto 18px;
        width: fit-content;
        border: 1px solid #fad4d4;
      }
      .expiry-note strong { font-weight: 700; color: #5a0000; margin: 0 2px; }
      .warning-box {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 10px;
        background: #fffbea;
        border: 1px solid #f5df8a;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #5a4a00;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .disclaimer { font-size: 14px; color: #6c879b; border-top: 1px solid #e4edf5; padding-top: 24px; margin-top: 10px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.6; }
      .footer { background: #f7fbfe; padding: 22px 40px 20px; border-top: 1px solid #dae9f5; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #5d7e9c; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
      .footer-links { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .footer-links a { color: #1d5b99; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 12px; }
      .separator { height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #b6d2ea, transparent); margin: 6px 0 10px; }
      .copyright { color: #7f99b2; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-card">
      <div class="accent-bar"></div>
      <div class="content">
        <h1>Reset your password</h1>
        <div class="greeting">Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</div>
        <div class="message">
          We received a request to reset the password for <strong><%= email %></strong>.
          Use the one-time code below to proceed. If you did not make this request, ignore this email — your password will not change.
        </div>
        <div class="otp-block">
          <div class="otp-label">Your reset code</div>
          <div class="otp-code"><%= otp %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="expiry-note">
          <span>⏳</span>
          <span>Expires in <strong><%= expirationMinutes %></strong> minutes</span>
        </div>
        <div class="warning-box">
          <span>⚠️</span>
          <span>Never share this code with anyone. Project Review Portal staff will never ask for it.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="disclaimer">
          If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="#">Help Center</a>
          <a href="#">Privacy</a>
          <a href="#">Terms</a>
        </div>
        <div class="separator"></div>
        <div class="copyright">&copy; Project Review Portal. All rights reserved.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
